Key Takeaways
•	Confidentiality — Who can SEE the data?
•	Integrity — Who can CHANGE the data?
•	Availability — Can I USE the system when required?
•	Authentication — WHO are you?
•	Authorization — WHAT are you allowed to do?
•	Non-repudiation — Can reliable evidence prevent denial of an action?
Security isn't just about preventing unauthorized access; we need to protect confidentiality, maintain integrity, ensure availability, establish strong identity, and enforce appropriate authorization.
